1
00:00:00,220 --> 00:00:02,515
A viewer asked for head-to-head tower defense.

2
00:00:03,008 --> 00:00:05,653
It is playable now, and even supports four versus four.

3
00:00:06,920 --> 00:00:08,990
This wish received eleven votes.

4
00:00:09,482 --> 00:00:11,828
The request was specific: earn income over time,

5
00:00:11,920 --> 00:00:14,140
upgrade a bank, deploy different units,

6
00:00:14,270 --> 00:00:15,615
and battle friends online.

7
00:00:16,887 --> 00:00:19,707
I made it a Versus mode inside 虫潮围城, Swarm Siege.

8
00:00:20,212 --> 00:00:21,107
Play one versus one,

9
00:00:21,224 --> 00:00:24,269
or choose two versus two, three versus three, or four versus four.

10
00:00:25,520 --> 00:00:26,665
You start with 600 gold.

11
00:00:26,795 --> 00:00:28,465
Spend 500 upgrading your bank,

12
00:00:28,595 --> 00:00:30,202
and only 100 remains.

13
00:00:30,708 --> 00:00:31,853
Want to deploy right away?

14
00:00:32,358 --> 00:00:33,578
Wait for the next income payment.

15
00:00:34,853 --> 00:00:36,411
The bank pays every ten seconds.

16
00:00:36,653 --> 00:00:38,936
Upgrading raises each payment from 60 to 85.

17
00:00:39,441 --> 00:00:40,661
You earn more over time,

18
00:00:40,916 --> 00:00:42,861
but your opponent will not wait for your economy.

19
00:00:44,153 --> 00:00:47,523
Save enough gold, then deploy bug swarms and machine-gun squads.

20
00:00:48,028 --> 00:00:49,661
They advance along your chosen route,

21
00:00:49,928 --> 00:00:50,798
engage enemies,

22
00:00:51,078 --> 00:00:53,161
and try to destroy the opposing core.

23
00:00:54,420 --> 00:00:56,228
Join your troops on the front line,

24
00:00:56,520 --> 00:00:58,402
shoot, and throw grenades.

25
00:00:58,895 --> 00:00:59,915
Manage your money

26
00:01:00,158 --> 00:01:01,240
and keep an eye on the battlefield.

27
00:01:02,520 --> 00:01:05,678
Each player has a separate wallet and bank in team matches.

28
00:01:05,858 --> 00:01:07,415
You can transfer 200 gold to a teammate.

29
00:01:07,908 --> 00:01:10,265
This four-versus-four demonstration uses me and seven bots.

30
00:01:10,633 --> 00:01:12,477
Online rooms support up to eight human players.

31
00:01:13,720 --> 00:01:15,002
I beat the computer in one versus one,

32
00:01:15,182 --> 00:01:16,802
but lost a separate four-versus-four match.

33
00:01:17,295 --> 00:01:18,515
At the fifteen-minute limit,

34
00:01:18,795 --> 00:01:20,852
our core had 76 percent health left,

35
00:01:21,083 --> 00:01:22,378
and theirs had 91 percent.

36
00:01:22,883 --> 00:01:23,778
Deploying more troops

37
00:01:23,995 --> 00:01:24,652
does not guarantee a win.

38
00:01:25,133 --> 00:01:28,452
Next I will keep refining match pacing and unit balance.

39
00:01:29,720 --> 00:01:32,752
The wish is now marked as fulfilled and playable.

40
00:01:32,932 --> 00:01:34,940
The original request and eleven votes are preserved.

41
00:01:35,445 --> 00:01:38,152
Try it on Bilibili Toy or Treasure Box.

42
00:01:38,645 --> 00:01:41,227
Would you upgrade your bank first, or deploy units first?
